
  = wtm's daemon is not running

  build   <build>
  jobs    none
  socket  <root>/home/Library/Application Support/wtm/wtm.sock
  index   <root>/home/Library/Application Support/wtm/jobs.json
  ! the index of jobs <root>/home/Library/Application Support/wtm/jobs.json was written by a newer wtm: nothing started here is recorded, so no restart brings it back — run the newer wtm, or remove the file once nothing runs

